   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-vYviwryVmYc/WC91dKTBWrI/AAAAAAAACck/gzhlTyTkICwNencf2xHRU-yXLnVS_PLEgCLcB/s1600/123.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-vYviwryVmYc/WC91dKTBWrI/AAAAAAAACck/gzhlTyTkICwNencf2xHRU-yXLnVS_PLEgCLcB/s1600/123.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237843871000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2PCJ4XCySq_pUmSJ29Zu2c\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-vYviwryVmYc/WC91dKTBWrI/AAAAAAAACck/gzhlTyTkICwNencf2xHRU-yXLnVS_PLEgCLcB/s1600/123.png\" border=\"0\"></a></p><br><div><br></div><div><div>問題是這樣的，我想要拆表，  因為 hcadata 不一定只到 5</div><div><br></div><div>有什麼辦法可以方便自動拆表，並塞入自動建立變數中....</div></div><div><br></div><div>假設產生 1 ~ k</div><div><br></div><div>我們會建立 play1 ~ playk 的變數。</div><div><br></div><div>P.S : 上面的範例 5 其實就是暫定的 k</div><div><br></div><div>assign() 文件範例 :</div><div><br></div><div><pre>for(i in 1:6) { #-- Create objects  &#39;r.1&#39;, &#39;r.2&#39;, ... &#39;r.6&#39; --\r\n    nam &lt;- paste(&quot;r&quot;, i, sep = &quot;.&quot;)\r\n    assign(nam, 1:i)\r\n}\r\nls(pattern = &quot;^r..$&quot;)</pre><pre><br></pre><pre><br></pre><pre><br></pre></div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-I1hM_nJOb3E/WC93GhmjvtI/AAAAAAAACcs/pkr6wfNdm0wJphUrBQlbiHDJBsfJ_eSYQCLcB/s1600/rassign.PNG\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-I1hM_nJOb3E/WC93GhmjvtI/AAAAAAAACcs/pkr6wfNdm0wJphUrBQlbiHDJBsfJ_eSYQCLcB/s1600/rassign.PNG&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237843871000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1e2rzQlznBJDgCzf9R-XR2\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-I1hM_nJOb3E/WC93GhmjvtI/AAAAAAAACcs/pkr6wfNdm0wJphUrBQlbiHDJBsfJ_eSYQCLcB/s1600/rassign.PNG\" border=\"0\"></a></p><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>自己想要用 一個 for 自動建立 1 ~ k 的變數，將 assign() 與 DF條件用在一起，但目前試不出來 OAQ</div><div><br></div><div>不知道大家有什麼好方法 。</div><div><br></div><div>範例資料如下 :</div><div><br></div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-Ipl_gDVbIuU/WC97p2WQF_I/AAAAAAAACc4/SyYvAJH6WeI7MYZJNpJDNPHBeC_qp7DOgCLcB/s1600/test.PNG\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-Ipl_gDVbIuU/WC97p2WQF_I/AAAAAAAACc4/SyYvAJH6WeI7MYZJNpJDNPHBeC_qp7DOgCLcB/s1600/test.PNG&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237843871000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2vWGSnjeNVR3uiH2mu1i2o\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-Ipl_gDVbIuU/WC97p2WQF_I/AAAAAAAACc4/SyYvAJH6WeI7MYZJNpJDNPHBeC_qp7DOgCLcB/s1600/test.PNG\" border=\"0\"></a></p><div><br></div><div><br></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
