    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div> </div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-clKh1lwxESg/WC-kfYL2zzI/AAAAAAAACdI/sHNncIANwCEFfh6VVeaYE6fLAbXZB3--QCLcB/s1600/FK1.PNG\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-clKh1lwxESg/WC-kfYL2zzI/AAAAAAAACdI/sHNncIANwCEFfh6VVeaYE6fLAbXZB3--QCLcB/s1600/FK1.PNG&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237843872000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1s3fvdBny1ZWxREK9XKpMq\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-clKh1lwxESg/WC-kfYL2zzI/AAAAAAAACdI/sHNncIANwCEFfh6VVeaYE6fLAbXZB3--QCLcB/s1600/FK1.PNG\" border=\"0\"></a></p><div><br></div><div><div>P.S : 我寫出來了...，不知道大家有什麼更好的寫法 OwO</div><div><br></div><div>test = hcaon(im13,  hacbdt, pkb)</div><div><br></div><div>for(i in 1:5) {</div><div>    nam = paste(&quot;hc&quot;, i, sep = &quot;.&quot;)</div><div>    assign(nam, test[test$hcadata == i, ])</div><div>}</div><div>ls()</div><div>head(hc.1)</div><div>head(hc.2)</div><div>head(hc.3)</div><div>head(hc.4)</div><div>head(hc.5)</div></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "lsALdux_CQAJ",
   "from": "WEPA ^_^",
   "author": "d42e88b7645d03c8",
   "date": "2016-11-19T16:32:03Z",
   "subject": "Re: data.frame 拆表與 assign()",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi friend,<div><br></div><div>本例可考慮先使用by, 測試500萬筆資料結果, 先用<font color=\"#ff0000\">by</font> 再用 loop, 應該有較佳結果, 例: (3.578252-2.533548)/2.533548=41%, 使用 <font color=\"#ff0000\">nlevels(test$hcadata) </font>可提升程式重複使用性.</div><div><br></div><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-dPy2KwHKjN4/WDB99FfDYQI/AAAAAAAAK4M/4HNZF8LWJo8mEa68WOtciGyRVQvsiQYLgCLcB/s1600/%25E5%258F%2596%25E5%2587%25BAdata.frame%25E5%25AD%2590%25E9%259B%2586%25E5%2590%2588.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-dPy2KwHKjN4/WDB99FfDYQI/AAAAAAAAK4M/4HNZF8LWJo8mEa68WOtciGyRVQvsiQYLgCLcB/s1600/%2525E5%25258F%252596%2525E5%252587%2525BAdata.frame%2525E5%2525AD%252590%2525E9%25259B%252586%2525E5%252590%252588.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237843873000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2NQPO0MVaJQ9wM8B6JW1rq\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-dPy2KwHKjN4/WDB99FfDYQI/AAAAAAAAK4M/4HNZF8LWJo8mEa68WOtciGyRVQvsiQYLgCLcB/s400/%25E5%258F%2596%25E5%2587%25BAdata.frame%25E5%25AD%2590%25E9%259B%2586%25E5%2590%2588.png\" border=\"0\" width=\"383\" height=\"400\"></a></p><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>###</div><div><div># title: 取出data.frame子集合</div><div># date: 2016.11.19</div><div><br></div><div># hint: 本案例可考慮先計算每個hcadata之個數</div><div>set.seed(168)</div><div>iris$hcadata &lt;- factor(c(rep(1:4, each=6), 5))</div><div>samplesize &lt;- 5000000</div><div>ind &lt;- sample(nrow(iris), samplesize, replace=TRUE)</div><div>test &lt;- iris[ind, ]</div><div><br></div><div>by.start &lt;- Sys.time()</div><div>x &lt;- by(test, test$hcadata, data.frame)</div><div>for(i in 1:nlevels(test$hcadata)) {</div><div>  nam &lt;- paste(&quot;hc&quot;, i, sep = &quot;_&quot;)</div><div>  assign(nam, x[[i]])</div><div>}</div><div>by.end &lt;- Sys.time()</div><div>by.end - by.start</div><div><br></div><div>for.start &lt;- Sys.time()</div></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     2,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div>for(i in 1:5) {</div><div>  nam = paste(&quot;hc&quot;, i, sep = &quot;.&quot;)</div><div>  assign(nam, test[test$hcadata == i, ])</div><div>}</div></div></div>"
    ],
